---
import ProseLayout from "@/layouts/ProseLayout.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "@/config";
---
<ProseLayout title="Good. Now put it to work." description="Your purchase is complete." eyebrow="Purchase complete" noindex={true}><p>Your receipt and download information are being delivered through Lemon Squeezy to the email address you used at checkout.</p><p>Do not treat this like something to read and file away. Start with the introduction, make the first real business decision the guide asks for, and use the worksheets on an actual offer, project, prospect, client, or product as soon as possible. The value is in changing what you do next.</p><p>Save the delivery email so you can return to the files when the same decision comes up again.</p>{siteConfig.supportEmail ? <p>If you have trouble accessing the purchase, email <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.supportEmail}`}>{siteConfig.supportEmail}</a>.</p> : <p class="rounded-lg border border-warning/30 bg-warning/10 p-4 text-warning">Support contact is awaiting production configuration.</p>}</ProseLayout>
